<!doctype html><html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Login · WargaKita</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"></head><body class="login-body"><div class="login-card"><div class="login-visual"><div class="brand-icon big">⌂</div><h1>WargaKita</h1><p>Sistem Informasi RT/RW</p><div class="visual-note">Pelayanan warga, kini lebih mudah.</div></div><div class="login-form"><div class="eyebrow">SELAMAT DATANG</div><h2>Masuk ke akun Anda</h2><p class="muted">Gunakan email dan password yang telah terdaftar.</p><% if(error){ %><div class="alert error"><%= error %></div><% } %><form method="post" action="/login"><label>Email</label><input type="email" name="email" placeholder="nama@email.com" required autocomplete="username"><label>Password</label><input type="password" name="password" placeholder="Masukkan password" required autocomplete="current-password"><button class="btn primary full">Masuk ke Dashboard →</button></form><div class="login-foot">Akses sesuai peran: Staff RW, Ketua RT, dan Warga.</div></div></div></body></html>